tag\" >FEATURE LIST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photogrammetry of ethnographic museums</strong> – To get unique graphics, we visited ethnographic museums. We scanned hundreds of objects and entire buildings, so you can admire them in the game the way they actually are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/682816ed06af6a9903dbc29c7540061d.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time travel</strong> – Teleport between four main seasons far away from each other by many years. Get to know the stories of the same heroes at different stages of their lives. Use your power to solve the mystery! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/dd5e131e02a1bd7f4522180dfc54d768.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear and engaging story</strong> – Experience particular immersive stories at your own pace and at the moment you feel like it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/e6b84b320e099d2ced9d5284df8a1c60.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequences of time manipulation</strong> – Set the paths of fate and bring the course of events back on the right track to discover further fragments of the game world and story. Events from the past have an impact on the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/72691289d3cc1342bd5b7309e64a2cbe.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slavic culture</strong> – Enjoy not only the immersive story but also look at the long-forgotten everyday activities and objects that are no longer used today. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/22dd2505bb2798dde42bd80a4397e925.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Open World</strong> – Travel between the homesteads and the surroundings of the village, discovering pieces of the mystery that lies somewhere there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/72420bbddd6da6b4049c6593e8299df6.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic environment</strong> – The time of day, weather, and lighting change smoothly and dynamically right before your eyes as you discover parts of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/extras/d6b1bec2680aad732542cda604646120.avif?t=1783523181\" width=600 height=248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The End of the Sun: Prologue is a first-person, story-driven mystery adventure set in a Slavic fantasy world. As the ashter, a sage sorcerer gifted with the ability to travel in time, you come to a mysterious village where the line between myth and reality begins to fade perilously.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Get ready for truly witcher-like encounters and investigations involving mythological creatures such as drowners or nightwraiths, the rituals of Forefathers’ Eve, Kupala Night, and even mushroom trips in the company of the kind-hearted Slavic god Svarog.”<br>CD-Action<br><br>“A title that has been in development for many years, but after this long wait, it manages to be highly appreciated for the depth of the stories woven into the narrative and its rather stunning technical and graphical quality, very close to another similar work: What Remains of Edith Finch.”<br>Gamescore<br><br>“Clearly nothing was done half-heartedly in the development of this game, and I thoroughly enjoyed my time with it. It definitely sparked my own wanderlust, and is sure to kindle the interest of anyone who appreciates exploring other historical cultures.”<br>Adventure Game Hot Spot<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/eb5473d3bfde96c92700fa89eb4572d026839816/header.jpg?t=1783523181", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/cbf9955c44618cc9c2f6feacc7ef1ba8e6cebfba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783523181", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820900/cbf9955c44618cc9c2f6feacc7ef1ba8e6cebfba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783523181", "website": "http://www.endofsun.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Phenom II X4 975 / Intel Core i5-750 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon HD 7970 / (2GB VRAM minimum / 4GB VRAM recommended)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphic Preset: Low / Resolution: 1080p / Target FPS: 30 / SSD recommended / (NOTE: The initial graphics preset is set to 'Highest' and is not automatically adjusted based on hardware. For minimal requirements, we recommend changing the graphics preset in the main menu before starting a new game.)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600XT / Intel Core i7-8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070 SUPER / AMD Radeon RX 6700 / (8GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Graphic Preset: High / Resolution: 1080p / Target FPS: 60 / SSD recommended / (NOTE: The initial graphics preset is set to 'Highest' and is not automatically adjusted based on hardware.)</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "We prohibit the use of our assets for training AI models without permission.", "developers": ["The End of the Sun Forge"], "publishers": ["The End of the Sun Forge"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28